sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Workload Telemetry Collector
    participant Engine as Optimizer Engine
    participant Advisor as Savings Advisor
    participant Remediator as Auto Remediator

    Client->>Engine: Submit ResourceMetrics Payload
    Engine->>Advisor: Send OptimizationResult List
    Advisor-->>Engine: Return SavingsReport Summary
    Engine->>Remediator: Trigger Auto-Remediation Policy
    Remediator-->>Client: Execution Log & Remediation Status
